#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/perl-modules/perl-lwp-protocol-https.xml:22
#, xml-text
msgid "Introduction to LWP::Protocol::https"
msgstr "Introdução ao \"LWP::Protocol::https\""

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/perl-modules/perl-lwp-protocol-https.xml:25
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"LWP::Protocol::https provides https support for LWP::UserAgent (i.e.  <xref "
"linkend=\"perl-libwww-perl\"/>). Once the module is installed LWP is able to"
" access sites using HTTP over SSL/TLS."
msgstr ""
"\"LWP::Protocol::https\" fornece suporte \"HTTPS\" para \"LWP::UserAgent\" "
"(ou seja, <xref linkend=\"perl-libwww-perl\"/>). Depois que o módulo estiver"
" instalado, o \"LWP\" será capaz de acessar sítios usando \"HTTP\" sobre "
"\"SSL\"/\"TLS\"."

